(7269368, 1129889, 13077, '<td valign="top">I would have composed to include less sky and more buildings - that''s the subject and where all the visual drama is happening. Had there been a dramatic sunrise, this composition would make sense, but I don''t think having nearly half of the photo be of a hazy sky helps it any.<br/>Still, I do like all the variety of shapes and colors in the skyscrapers and the monotonous yellow sprawl in the background.</td>', 'I would have composed to include less sky and more buildings - that''s the subject and where all the visual drama is happening. Had there been a dramatic sunrise, this composition would make sense, but I don''t think having nearly half of the photo be of a hazy sky helps it any.Still, I do like all the variety of shapes and colors in the skyscrapers and the monotonous yellow sprawl in the background.', '2014-10-04 16:23:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269369, 1131089, 149964, '<td valign="top">Great photograph, even if I"m not a fan of the subject matter :-)</td>', 'Great photograph, even if I"m not a fan of the subject matter :-)', '2014-10-04 16:23:55.000000', NULL, 1),
