(7269376, 1130977, 13077, '<td valign="top">Had to google the name - I suppose if he turned his vision onto an architectural subject he might tend to cover it with uniform, sterile white dots instead of the organic blobs and gradients that cover his close-up, warts-and-all human portraits.<br/> <br/>I''ll have to check back and see how this effect was achieved.</td>', 'Had to google the name - I suppose if he turned his vision onto an architectural subject he might tend to cover it with uniform, sterile white dots instead of the organic blobs and gradients that cover his close-up, warts-and-all human portraits. I''ll have to check back and see how this effect was achieved.', '2014-10-04 16:27:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269377, 1131164, 149964, '<td valign="top">Wow! Beautiful colours and contrasts.</td>', 'Wow! Beautiful colours and contrasts.', '2014-10-04 16:27:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269378, 1131166, 149964, '<td valign="top">Sweet.</td>', 'Sweet.', '2014-10-04 16:29:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269379, 1131082, 149964, '<td valign="top">Like the textures on this.</td>', 'Like the textures on this.', '2014-10-04 16:29:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269380, 1131115, 13077, '<td valign="top">The title you''ve given it fits well, the pose of the bird implies turbulence as well as the waters below. Still, the water being as in-focus as it is makes for a pretty busy background which I''m not super crazy about, and I think a crop to remove a bit from the top and the bottom would have looked better.</td>', 'The title you''ve given it fits well, the pose of the bird implies turbulence as well as the waters below. Still, the water being as in-focus as it is makes for a pretty busy background which I''m not super crazy about, and I think a crop to remove a bit from the top and the bottom would have looked better.', '2014-10-04 16:30:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269381, 1131147, 149964, '<td valign="top">Different subject.  Like the colours and textures.</td>', 'Different subject.  Like the colours and textures.', '2014-10-04 16:30:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269383, 1129809, 149964, '<td valign="top">Love the way the leaf is set off against the blue.</td>', 'Love the way the leaf is set off against the blue.', '2014-10-04 16:31:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269384, 1131100, 149964, '<td valign="top">Really like the colours and serenity of this.</td>', 'Really like the colours and serenity of this.', '2014-10-04 16:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269385, 1130212, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like the overall feel and the war between softness and sharpness, but something about the composition to me seems a little too busy. This scene is beautiful, so if you go back another night and if you could get closer to that wall of rocks in the foreground I''m sure you could come away with something even better.</td>', 'I like the overall feel and the war between softness and sharpness, but something about the composition to me seems a little too busy. This scene is beautiful, so if you go back another night and if you could get closer to that wall of rocks in the foreground I''m sure you could come away with something even better.', '2014-10-04 16:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269386, 1131157, 149964, '<td valign="top">There''s a story..... wonder where they''re going and why? Like this.</td>', 'There''s a story..... wonder where they''re going and why? Like this.', '2014-10-04 16:32:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269387, 1130895, 13077, '<td valign="top">Beautiful tones. Also, tack-sharp waves, unusual to see in a low-light photo. Not sure I like the crop, though, a bit too much negative space at the top for my taste. Might work well for a poster or advertisement of some sort, though, with some text up there.</td>', 'Beautiful tones. Also, tack-sharp waves, unusual to see in a low-light photo. Not sure I like the crop, though, a bit too much negative space at the top for my taste. Might work well for a poster or advertisement of some sort, though, with some text up there.', '2014-10-04 16:33:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269388, 1130946, 13077, '<td valign="top">Those shapes are just plain cool. Wondering what they were caused by.</td>', 'Those shapes are just plain cool. Wondering what they were caused by.', '2014-10-04 16:36:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269389, 1131122, 13077, '<td valign="top">Is that any painted on? That is really cool. Also I can''t quite tell what the shape inside the window is - maybe a man''s back, lit by a bright yellow light inside there?</td>', 'Is that any painted on? That is really cool. Also I can''t quite tell what the shape inside the window is - maybe a man''s back, lit by a bright yellow light inside there?', '2014-10-04 16:38:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269392, 1130911, 13077, '<td valign="top">Jake: No I don''t like it...<br/>[Elwood Blues floors the pedal and jumps over an open drawbridge]<br/>Jake: Car''s got a lot of pickup.<br/>Elwood: It''s got a cop motor, a 440 cubic inch plant, it''s got cop tires, cop suspensions, cop shocks. It''s a model made before catalytic converters so it''ll run good on regular gas. What do you say, is it the new Bluesmobile or what?</td>', 'Jake: No I don''t like it...[Elwood Blues floors the pedal and jumps over an open drawbridge]Jake: Car''s got a lot of pickup.Elwood: It''s got a cop motor, a 440 cubic inch plant, it''s got cop tires, cop suspensions, cop shocks. It''s a model made before catalytic converters so it''ll run good on regular gas. What do you say, is it the new Bluesmobile or what?', '2014-10-04 16:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269396, 1131148, 13077, '<td valign="top">What a cute little bird.</td>', 'What a cute little bird.', '2014-10-04 16:49:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269398, 1130562, 13077, '<td valign="top">That''s not something you see every day...</td>', 'That''s not something you see every day...', '2014-10-04 16:50:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269399, 1131141, 13077, '<td valign="top">Wonder what he''s pointing at.</td>', 'Wonder what he''s pointing at.', '2014-10-04 16:51:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269400, 1130517, 13077, '<td valign="top">Well composed, good processing and I like the single, small human element.</td>', 'Well composed, good processing and I like the single, small human element.', '2014-10-04 16:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269402, 1131042, 13077, '<td valign="top">Looks like the shutter speed was slow enough to pull in some ambient light along with the flash, which is probably why the deer are not all that sharp.<br/>I''m not a fan of the border.</td>', 'Looks like the shutter speed was slow enough to pull in some ambient light along with the flash, which is probably why the deer are not all that sharp.I''m not a fan of the border.', '2014-10-04 16:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269403, 1130337, 13077, '<td valign="top">This is intriguing - what jumped out at me is how some of the elements add tension and frustration by blocking each other - the pole seems to block the "watcher"''s view of the sky, as well as blocking our view of the lettering on the window, and the crosswalk pole blocks part of the signs behind it.<br/>Overall, I like it - it''s an interesting take on a scene easily overlooked, and presents it in an unusual way between the processing and the title.</td>', 'This is intriguing - what jumped out at me is how some of the elements add tension and frustration by blocking each other - the pole seems to block the "watcher"''s view of the sky, as well as blocking our view of the lettering on the window, and the crosswalk pole blocks part of the signs behind it.Overall, I like it - it''s an interesting take on a scene easily overlooked, and presents it in an unusual way between the processing and the title.', '2014-10-04 16:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269404, 1130548, 13077, '<td valign="top">Nope, just a ''snort''</td>', 'Nope, just a ''snort''', '2014-10-04 16:56:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269405, 1130759, 13077, '<td valign="top">I think it would have worked better had the hiker been caught while he was nearer to the left part of the frame, walking up. The scale is appropriate to give the impression of the ''grandness'' of the canyon vs. the smallness of the hiker, but our eyes are used to reading left to right and where he is in the frame he just sort of gets lost in clutter.</td>', 'I think it would have worked better had the hiker been caught while he was nearer to the left part of the frame, walking up. The scale is appropriate to give the impression of the ''grandness'' of the canyon vs. the smallness of the hiker, but our eyes are used to reading left to right and where he is in the frame he just sort of gets lost in clutter.', '2014-10-04 16:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269406, 1130204, 13077, '<td valign="top">Interesting title, and good photo above it. I especially like the green moss on the rocks to the left.</td>', 'Interesting title, and good photo above it. I especially like the green moss on the rocks to the left.', '2014-10-04 16:59:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269407, 1131192, 13077, '<td valign="top">I can''t tell if the subject is meant to be the dogs or the guy walking away from them. The dogs have been caught in an interesting pose, so I would have tried to get closer and fill most of the frame with the dogs.</td>', 'I can''t tell if the subject is meant to be the dogs or the guy walking away from them. The dogs have been caught in an interesting pose, so I would have tried to get closer and fill most of the frame with the dogs.', '2014-10-04 17:00:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269408, 1130385, 13077, '<td valign="top">Nicely lit, and the title seems to illustrate the dog''s thought.</td>', 'Nicely lit, and the title seems to illustrate the dog''s thought.', '2014-10-04 17:01:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269409, 1131012, 13077, '<td valign="top">Very nice - just enough contrast, and well composed.</td>', 'Very nice - just enough contrast, and well composed.', '2014-10-04 17:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
