(7269472, 1130015, 13077, '<td valign="top">Interesting scene - I like the rows of various colors, and things that are presumably for making hats on display up there.</td>', 'Interesting scene - I like the rows of various colors, and things that are presumably for making hats on display up there.', '2014-10-04 23:51:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269473, 1130040, 13077, '<td valign="top">Great detail on the bird, even the highlights have details still visible, but the background is too in-focus and too similar in tone and lightness to the bird, and the bird doesn''t pop out as well as it could have. I don''t know how much room you had to move around, but with a background to really make the subject pop this would have been much better.</td>', 'Great detail on the bird, even the highlights have details still visible, but the background is too in-focus and too similar in tone and lightness to the bird, and the bird doesn''t pop out as well as it could have. I don''t know how much room you had to move around, but with a background to really make the subject pop this would have been much better.', '2014-10-04 23:53:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269474, 1131015, 13077, '<td valign="top">clap your hands! (clap, clap)<br/> <br/>It does look like a happy lizard, laying out in the sun. Excellent sharpness and light, and with a background that really makes him pop out from it.</td>', 'clap your hands! (clap, clap) It does look like a happy lizard, laying out in the sun. Excellent sharpness and light, and with a background that really makes him pop out from it.', '2014-10-04 23:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269475, 1130808, 13077, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene and a nice moment, well captured and well exposed to keep good detail in the shadows. Lucky the horses were light colored too.</td>', 'Beautiful scene and a nice moment, well captured and well exposed to keep good detail in the shadows. Lucky the horses were light colored too.', '2014-10-04 23:55:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269476, 1130328, 13077, '<td valign="top">Good candid, and I like the title.<br/>At first glance the composition seems a bit busy, but when I look at the row of people all doing their own thing looking in various directions they all become obvious pieces of this moment. It does feel a bit cramped on the right side, though, as several of them seem to be looking off to the right.</td>', 'Good candid, and I like the title.At first glance the composition seems a bit busy, but when I look at the row of people all doing their own thing looking in various directions they all become obvious pieces of this moment. It does feel a bit cramped on the right side, though, as several of them seem to be looking off to the right.', '2014-10-04 23:58:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269477, 1130659, 13077, '<td valign="top">Great variety of tones and colors here, and nicely exposed. The tall tree with the bird perched atop it on the far right is a nice touch, but having it so much taller than everything else and at the very end of the photo makes it feel unbalanced to me. I think a more wide-shaped crop would just exaggerate that, so I might have done without the tall tree altogether.</td>', 'Great variety of tones and colors here, and nicely exposed. The tall tree with the bird perched atop it on the far right is a nice touch, but having it so much taller than everything else and at the very end of the photo makes it feel unbalanced to me. I think a more wide-shaped crop would just exaggerate that, so I might have done without the tall tree altogether.', '2014-10-05 00:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269488, 1130463, 13077, '<td valign="top">Or maybe they bought headstones early and didn''t expect to live so long, but outlived the morgue?</td>', 'Or maybe they bought headstones early and didn''t expect to live so long, but outlived the morgue?', '2014-10-05 00:32:06.000000', NULL, 1),
