(7269523, 1130753, 13077, '<td valign="top">Perfect exposure time for the whirling thing in the foreground, although some more exposure on the background would''ve helped a bit in my opinion. If you shot it in RAW, you could "develop" it with various "exposures" and merge them into an HDR image which would achieve this pretty well assuming the ISO was low enough not to have too much grain.</td>', 'Perfect exposure time for the whirling thing in the foreground, although some more exposure on the background would''ve helped a bit in my opinion. If you shot it in RAW, you could "develop" it with various "exposures" and merge them into an HDR image which would achieve this pretty well assuming the ISO was low enough not to have too much grain.', '2014-10-05 00:47:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269524, 1131141, 86447, '<td valign="top">I wish  you hadn''t told me this was a statue... I gave it a 7 (earlier), but.. I''d loved to have imagined that it was real...   *sigh*</td>', 'I wish  you hadn''t told me this was a statue... I gave it a 7 (earlier), but.. I''d loved to have imagined that it was real...   *sigh*', '2014-10-05 00:48:10.000000', NULL, 1),
