(7269539, 1130148, 13077, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice enough natural composition of colors on the hillside for sure, but as far as photos go this has the vibe of a from-the-road shot to me. There are so many back roads and bodies of water to be found up in/around the Rockies, I hope you did visit them and just used those pictures for other things :)</td>', 'It''s a nice enough natural composition of colors on the hillside for sure, but as far as photos go this has the vibe of a from-the-road shot to me. There are so many back roads and bodies of water to be found up in/around the Rockies, I hope you did visit them and just used those pictures for other things :)', '2014-10-05 01:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269540, 1130985, 13077, '<td valign="top">The stars have landed, they are at home on the tiny landscape of this tide-carved beach, ready to rest and wake again with the light of our star. Retirement!</td>', 'The stars have landed, they are at home on the tiny landscape of this tide-carved beach, ready to rest and wake again with the light of our star. Retirement!', '2014-10-05 01:03:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269541, 1131163, 13077, '<td valign="top">Even if all you had was a wide-angle lens, plenty of more interesting and visually appealing compositions could have been found here - it''s a very compelling scene, and even the arrangement of the players on the field as they are looks good, but it''s spoiled by the negative space and the blown-out blob of light.</td>', 'Even if all you had was a wide-angle lens, plenty of more interesting and visually appealing compositions could have been found here - it''s a very compelling scene, and even the arrangement of the players on the field as they are looks good, but it''s spoiled by the negative space and the blown-out blob of light.', '2014-10-05 01:05:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269542, 1131099, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like the sky here, and that is well processed, but I''m not crazy about all the darkness in the foreground. Some of it is light, but the rest (near the edges) looks like it''s been darkened after the fact for style reasons. Nothing wrong with that, just I''m not crazy about it.</td>', 'I like the sky here, and that is well processed, but I''m not crazy about all the darkness in the foreground. Some of it is light, but the rest (near the edges) looks like it''s been darkened after the fact for style reasons. Nothing wrong with that, just I''m not crazy about it.', '2014-10-05 01:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269543, 1130755, 13077, '<td valign="top">Delightful, classic scene and well composed, and I like the toning here.</td>', 'Delightful, classic scene and well composed, and I like the toning here.', '2014-10-05 01:07:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269544, 1131052, 13077, '<td valign="top">Appropriate amount of motion blur here, gives it a nice look, but I''m not crazy about the composition. Can''t really put my finger on why, though...</td>', 'Appropriate amount of motion blur here, gives it a nice look, but I''m not crazy about the composition. Can''t really put my finger on why, though...', '2014-10-05 01:12:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269545, 1131112, 13077, '<td valign="top">What are we remembering again?<br/>Oh, I rem.... nope, forgot again.</td>', 'What are we remembering again?Oh, I rem.... nope, forgot again.', '2014-10-05 01:13:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269547, 1130594, 13077, '<td valign="top">This looks like one of those tough-to-represent-with-a-photo scenes. Usually a newspaper photo would rely on a human element, but failing that a frame-filling, simple but carefully composed photo would probably represent it better than a wide angle view like this.<br/>As it is, all the elements of interest (the fountain, the structure, and especially the pillars with inscriptions and wreaths) are small but we have tons of space taken up by the tiles on the ground and the dark but cloudy, somewhat light-polluted, starless sky.</td>', 'This looks like one of those tough-to-represent-with-a-photo scenes. Usually a newspaper photo would rely on a human element, but failing that a frame-filling, simple but carefully composed photo would probably represent it better than a wide angle view like this.As it is, all the elements of interest (the fountain, the structure, and especially the pillars with inscriptions and wreaths) are small but we have tons of space taken up by the tiles on the ground and the dark but cloudy, somewhat light-polluted, starless sky.', '2014-10-05 01:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269548, 1131156, 13077, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed - so many layers both vertical and horizontal in this scene and they all play nicely together.</td>', 'Nicely composed - so many layers both vertical and horizontal in this scene and they all play nicely together.', '2014-10-05 01:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269549, 1130621, 13077, '<td valign="top">I''m sure it ain''t no picnic for the momma, but that''s life. Cute piggies, well captured here.</td>', 'I''m sure it ain''t no picnic for the momma, but that''s life. Cute piggies, well captured here.', '2014-10-05 01:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269550, 1130741, 13077, '<td valign="top">Nice. I like the tall grass with the waves of various colors in the foreground as well as the bit of autumn popping up across the mountainside. The clouds came together nicely in this scene as well, if only you''d had a ray of sunlight hitting the barn just then...</td>', 'Nice. I like the tall grass with the waves of various colors in the foreground as well as the bit of autumn popping up across the mountainside. The clouds came together nicely in this scene as well, if only you''d had a ray of sunlight hitting the barn just then...', '2014-10-05 01:21:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269552, 1131114, 13077, '<td valign="top">DNMC!<br/>(if this isn''t hahn23, then disregard this comment)<br/>;)</td>', 'DNMC!(if this isn''t hahn23, then disregard this comment);)', '2014-10-05 01:23:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269553, 1131072, 13077, '<td valign="top">Comin'' in hot... SPLASH!<br/>Nicely captured pose of the bird here.</td>', 'Comin'' in hot... SPLASH!Nicely captured pose of the bird here.', '2014-10-05 01:25:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269554, 1130264, 13077, '<td valign="top">Get comfortable there, manty, it''ll be a while...</td>', 'Get comfortable there, manty, it''ll be a while...', '2014-10-05 01:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269556, 1130110, 13077, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, punchy colors and I like the bit of detail still visible at the bottom of the lake. Looks like a wonderful place to spend time.<br/>The composition feels a little cramped with the crop so close to that rock on the left edge, but I have a feeling it was cropped to remove something else that would have distracted more. Might have been avoidable by re-positioning in any case.</td>', 'Beautiful, punchy colors and I like the bit of detail still visible at the bottom of the lake. Looks like a wonderful place to spend time.The composition feels a little cramped with the crop so close to that rock on the left edge, but I have a feeling it was cropped to remove something else that would have distracted more. Might have been avoidable by re-positioning in any case.', '2014-10-05 01:28:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269557, 1131161, 13077, '<td valign="top">Looks like he''s having a good time, that''s what it''s all about.</td>', 'Looks like he''s having a good time, that''s what it''s all about.', '2014-10-05 01:28:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269558, 1131027, 13077, '<td valign="top">It sure is. Nice tones and very sharp, but I think it could have been improved by getting closer to the beach and just including the bold shapes created by the sun''s reflections in part of the sand (if it still reflected at that lower angle). I don''t feel like the foliage in the foreground adds anything here.</td>', 'It sure is. Nice tones and very sharp, but I think it could have been improved by getting closer to the beach and just including the bold shapes created by the sun''s reflections in part of the sand (if it still reflected at that lower angle). I don''t feel like the foliage in the foreground adds anything here.', '2014-10-05 01:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269560, 1130923, 13077, '<td valign="top">Excellent, classic scene and well lit, good processing and the negative space actually improves it for this one. I like the fingerprints on the back of the desk too.</td>', 'Excellent, classic scene and well lit, good processing and the negative space actually improves it for this one. I like the fingerprints on the back of the desk too.', '2014-10-05 01:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269562, 1130930, 13077, '<td valign="top">What, you don''t have aurora borealis all day too? just kidding..<br/>Nicely done with the exposure here, the sharp contrasty rocks, colored foliage and waterfalls create all kinds of drama and the softness in the water and the clouds keep it all balanced.</td>', 'What, you don''t have aurora borealis all day too? just kidding..Nicely done with the exposure here, the sharp contrasty rocks, colored foliage and waterfalls create all kinds of drama and the softness in the water and the clouds keep it all balanced.', '2014-10-05 01:33:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269564, 1130059, 13077, '<td valign="top">Old vs. New. I''m thinking this would look so much better with a hint of dusk or dawn''s blue light to fill in all the shadows and bring some interest to all the dark water near the top.</td>', 'Old vs. New. I''m thinking this would look so much better with a hint of dusk or dawn''s blue light to fill in all the shadows and bring some interest to all the dark water near the top.', '2014-10-05 01:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269565, 1131087, 13077, '<td valign="top">Is it really? Very interesting... I like the drama created by the fog or steam or whatever it is...</td>', 'Is it really? Very interesting... I like the drama created by the fog or steam or whatever it is...', '2014-10-05 01:35:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269566, 1131154, 13077, '<td valign="top">Very nice candid, of an unusual side of a person to show but the shadows of the lady walking away and the other bystanders add a lot of interest.</td>', 'Very nice candid, of an unusual side of a person to show but the shadows of the lady walking away and the other bystanders add a lot of interest.', '2014-10-05 01:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269600, 1130385, 11854, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful portrait!</td>', 'What a beautiful portrait!', '2014-10-05 09:30:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269602, 1131177, 11854, '<td valign="top">Very spooky!</td>', 'Very spooky!', '2014-10-05 09:30:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269603, 1131130, 11854, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous!</td>', 'Gorgeous!', '2014-10-05 09:30:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269604, 1130976, 11854, '<td valign="top">It''s always best to confess to those who can''t repeat what you''ve confessed!</td>', 'It''s always best to confess to those who can''t repeat what you''ve confessed!', '2014-10-05 09:32:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269605, 1131002, 11854, '<td valign="top">I''m half asleep, didn''t drink my caffeine yet. And when I first looked at this I saw his "tilted" head and a big open mouth grin on his "face". LOL. Excellent detail.</td>', 'I''m half asleep, didn''t drink my caffeine yet. And when I first looked at this I saw his "tilted" head and a big open mouth grin on his "face". LOL. Excellent detail.', '2014-10-05 09:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269606, 1131149, 11854, '<td valign="top">Totally gorgeous!</td>', 'Totally gorgeous!', '2014-10-05 09:40:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269607, 1130212, 11854, '<td valign="top">So very dreamy. Love it!</td>', 'So very dreamy. Love it!', '2014-10-05 09:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269622, 1130295, 135629, '<td valign="top">An intentional shoutout to Sally Mann, in tintype style - love it. 10!</td>', 'An intentional shoutout to Sally Mann, in tintype style - love it. 10!', '2014-10-05 10:37:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269637, 1131155, 61396, '<td valign="top">priceless expression.<br/> <br/>(p.s. I would also try with less sharpening, as the current setting accentuate the fact that the focus is slightly too far out)</td>', 'priceless expression. (p.s. I would also try with less sharpening, as the current setting accentuate the fact that the focus is slightly too far out)', '2014-10-05 11:52:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269638, 1130862, 61396, '<td valign="top">I can''t get <i>Jack and the Beanstalk</i> fairy tail out of my head now.</td>', 'I can''t get Jack and the Beanstalk fairy tail out of my head now.', '2014-10-05 11:54:15.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(7269648, 1131129, 124982, '<td valign="top">Great B&amp;W image with awesome detail. One of my TT for the challenge.</td>', 'Great B&W image with awesome detail. One of my TT for the challenge.', '2014-10-05 12:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269649, 1130862, 124982, '<td valign="top">Great B&amp;W image, a little heavy on the tonemapping though (for my personal tastes). Still, excellent detail!</td>', 'Great B&W image, a little heavy on the tonemapping though (for my personal tastes). Still, excellent detail!', '2014-10-05 12:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269651, 1131099, 124982, '<td valign="top">Great image overall. Would love to see a little more detail in the shadows on the hill, and some dodging on the steps leading to the tower. Still, TT in my books.</td>', 'Great image overall. Would love to see a little more detail in the shadows on the hill, and some dodging on the steps leading to the tower. Still, TT in my books.', '2014-10-05 12:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269652, 1131082, 124982, '<td valign="top">So sad, they will be gone soon which is a travesty.</td>', 'So sad, they will be gone soon which is a travesty.', '2014-10-05 12:19:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269668, 1130765, 124982, '<td valign="top">I like the shot, but rarely find HDR tonemapping to be complimentary to people and animals.</td>', 'I like the shot, but rarely find HDR tonemapping to be complimentary to people and animals.', '2014-10-05 12:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269684, 1130733, 147314, '<td valign="top">Love the image, great composition, colours and processing!</td>', 'Love the image, great composition, colours and processing!', '2014-10-05 12:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269686, 1130385, 147314, '<td valign="top">Wow, one of the best portraits I''ve ever seen; that dog is adorable and a great add to this image!</td>', 'Wow, one of the best portraits I''ve ever seen; that dog is adorable and a great add to this image!', '2014-10-05 13:00:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269688, 1130212, 147314, '<td valign="top">The green toning adds an almost mystique atmosphere to this image, really like it.</td>', 'The green toning adds an almost mystique atmosphere to this image, really like it.', '2014-10-05 13:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269689, 1131115, 147314, '<td valign="top">Great image, I really like the POV and the processing.</td>', 'Great image, I really like the POV and the processing.', '2014-10-05 13:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269690, 1130808, 147314, '<td valign="top">Great light!</td>', 'Great light!', '2014-10-05 13:02:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269691, 1131087, 147314, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light, lovely image.</td>', 'Beautiful light, lovely image.', '2014-10-05 13:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269692, 1130948, 147314, '<td valign="top">Great image, I really like the way the (much used) music sheets, the (almost) dead roses, composition and processing gives this image a really dated atmosphere!</td>', 'Great image, I really like the way the (much used) music sheets, the (almost) dead roses, composition and processing gives this image a really dated atmosphere!', '2014-10-05 13:08:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269693, 1131130, 147314, '<td valign="top">Love this image, great view!</td>', 'Love this image, great view!', '2014-10-05 13:10:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269694, 1130333, 147314, '<td valign="top">Really like the speed effect in this image, makes it much more interesting. And -with the focus on the last rider- a very well chosen title!</td>', 'Really like the speed effect in this image, makes it much more interesting. And -with the focus on the last rider- a very well chosen title!', '2014-10-05 13:12:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269695, 1131201, 147314, '<td valign="top">Wow, great timing and good focus (you never know when these guys surface)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2014-10-08 06:50:57.</i></td>', 'Wow, great timing and good focus (you never know when these guys surface)', '2014-10-05 13:14:18.000000', '2014-10-08 07:50:57.000000', 1),
(7269696, 1129346, 147314, '<td valign="top">Fantastic macro, never ever seen something like this before. Beautiful!</td>', 'Fantastic macro, never ever seen something like this before. Beautiful!', '2014-10-05 13:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269697, 1130765, 147314, '<td valign="top">Really nice processing.</td>', 'Really nice processing.', '2014-10-05 13:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269699, 1130759, 147314, '<td valign="top">It is an interesting composition, but I think it needs a bit of processing to make it work (especially colours are not great).</td>', 'It is an interesting composition, but I think it needs a bit of processing to make it work (especially colours are not great).', '2014-10-05 13:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269705, 1130900, 147314, '<td valign="top">Could be a nice portrait, but his position is very central and I think you should have focussed on the fruit and the man and not on the man and background.</td>', 'Could be a nice portrait, but his position is very central and I think you should have focussed on the fruit and the man and not on the man and background.', '2014-10-05 13:24:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269707, 1130543, 147314, '<td valign="top">I like the distant layers, but find the foreground distracting</td>', 'I like the distant layers, but find the foreground distracting', '2014-10-05 13:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269710, 1129796, 147314, '<td valign="top">Can''t see the smile to be honest, nice portrait though.</td>', 'Can''t see the smile to be honest, nice portrait though.', '2014-10-05 13:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269711, 1130469, 118154, '<td valign="top">I,d like this if it was better.7.</td>', 'I,d like this if it was better.7.', '2014-10-05 13:28:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269712, 1131157, 118154, '<td valign="top">promising</td>', 'promising', '2014-10-05 13:29:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269713, 1131042, 147314, '<td valign="top">Could have been a great image, but I think the processing is a bit overdone.</td>', 'Could have been a great image, but I think the processing is a bit overdone.', '2014-10-05 13:30:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269714, 1130895, 147314, '<td valign="top">I think I would have liked this better with only a small amount of water; now the (processing of the) water is quite distracting.</td>', 'I think I would have liked this better with only a small amount of water; now the (processing of the) water is quite distracting.', '2014-10-05 13:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269715, 1130741, 147314, '<td valign="top">Although a really nice landscape, I think subject-wise it lacks a bit of interest.</td>', 'Although a really nice landscape, I think subject-wise it lacks a bit of interest.', '2014-10-05 13:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269716, 1130672, 147314, '<td valign="top">It''s a pity the wings are covering most of the bird''s head.</td>', 'It''s a pity the wings are covering most of the bird''s head.', '2014-10-05 13:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269722, 1130517, 37858, '<td valign="top">I like this image because of the mist and the far shore, the churning water, the figure on the rock, and the scale of the image as seen from this vantage point.  I wish the lower left corner wasn''t quite so dark, though.  I think that part of the image could have added more to the strength of the photograph without taking anything away from the water if it had been ever-so-slightly lightened.  Still, It''s a fine image as is.</td>', 'I like this image because of the mist and the far shore, the churning water, the figure on the rock, and the scale of the image as seen from this vantage point.  I wish the lower left corner wasn''t quite so dark, though.  I think that part of the image could have added more to the strength of the photograph without taking anything away from the water if it had been ever-so-slightly lightened.  Still, It''s a fine image as is.', '2014-10-05 14:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269729, 1131131, 124982, '<td valign="top">Nice detail, but find I''m rather burnt out on the subject having seen it previously. Also, some artifacting/sloppy masking on the right hand side I find to be very distracting.</td>', 'Nice detail, but find I''m rather burnt out on the subject having seen it previously. Also, some artifacting/sloppy masking on the right hand side I find to be very distracting.', '2014-10-05 15:24:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269731, 1130248, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like the little bit of motion bur at the edges of the bird''s wings. Nicely shot but I think a tighter crop might have improved it overall, especially when we''re viewing it at a small size here.</td>', 'I like the little bit of motion bur at the edges of the bird''s wings. Nicely shot but I think a tighter crop might have improved it overall, especially when we''re viewing it at a small size here.', '2014-10-05 15:59:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269732, 1131125, 13077, '<td valign="top">Looks like the beginning of a fun and relaxing day.</td>', 'Looks like the beginning of a fun and relaxing day.', '2014-10-05 16:00:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269733, 1130530, 13077, '<td valign="top">Nicely captured detail in the bobcat, especially his eyes.</td>', 'Nicely captured detail in the bobcat, especially his eyes.', '2014-10-05 16:10:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269734, 1130853, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot. Simple, graphic, interesting and very appealing.</td>', 'I like this a lot. Simple, graphic, interesting and very appealing.', '2014-10-05 16:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269735, 1131149, 13077, '<td valign="top">They sure are. Nice moment, well captured with sharp focus and good old-fashioned look to the processing.</td>', 'They sure are. Nice moment, well captured with sharp focus and good old-fashioned look to the processing.', '2014-10-05 16:23:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269736, 1130945, 13077, '<td valign="top">Very cool. Centered subjects that don''t fill the frame don''t always work, but with this one it''s in "in-your-face" kind of shot and the foreground and background give the subject some room to breathe. I like it a lot.</td>', 'Very cool. Centered subjects that don''t fill the frame don''t always work, but with this one it''s in "in-your-face" kind of shot and the foreground and background give the subject some room to breathe. I like it a lot.', '2014-10-05 16:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269737, 1131177, 13077, '<td valign="top">Very creepy, old-time vibe to it, I like all the angles and the negative space.</td>', 'Very creepy, old-time vibe to it, I like all the angles and the negative space.', '2014-10-05 16:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269738, 1130944, 13077, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors and the small ripples in the water look good, but I''m not sure the trees on the left add much. Maybe some silhouettes in the bottom of the frame might have worked better to complement the distant and simple horizon.</td>', 'Very nice colors and the small ripples in the water look good, but I''m not sure the trees on the left add much. Maybe some silhouettes in the bottom of the frame might have worked better to complement the distant and simple horizon.', '2014-10-05 16:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269739, 1131074, 13077, '<td valign="top">The motion in the clouds and the smoothed-out water look very good, and the composition is nice as well.</td>', 'The motion in the clouds and the smoothed-out water look very good, and the composition is nice as well.', '2014-10-05 16:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269740, 1131107, 13077, '<td valign="top">Wow, that''s a bunch of ''em. Nice light, contrast and patterns here.</td>', 'Wow, that''s a bunch of ''em. Nice light, contrast and patterns here.', '2014-10-05 16:28:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269741, 1131100, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like this - the cheery pastel colors and few shapes jutting up at various angles complemented by their reflections work very well together.</td>', 'I like this - the cheery pastel colors and few shapes jutting up at various angles complemented by their reflections work very well together.', '2014-10-05 16:29:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269742, 1130976, 13077, '<td valign="top">The scene and composition are nice, but the subject turned away from the camera and burying his face in his hand creates some uneasiness, not sure I like it.</td>', 'The scene and composition are nice, but the subject turned away from the camera and burying his face in his hand creates some uneasiness, not sure I like it.', '2014-10-05 16:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269744, 1129545, 13077, '<td valign="top">This is a nicely composed environmental portrait, with some good lighting although no doubt challenging dynamic-range wise. I think the processing is a little too harsh, though.</td>', 'This is a nicely composed environmental portrait, with some good lighting although no doubt challenging dynamic-range wise. I think the processing is a little too harsh, though.', '2014-10-05 16:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269745, 1130646, 13077, '<td valign="top">It''s all held together pretty well top and bottom by the smoothed water playing against the jagged rocks, and the smooth layer of clouds topped off by the little jagged ones. The horizon doesn''t seem very sharp, though, or it could be the processing/noise reduction.</td>', 'It''s all held together pretty well top and bottom by the smoothed water playing against the jagged rocks, and the smooth layer of clouds topped off by the little jagged ones. The horizon doesn''t seem very sharp, though, or it could be the processing/noise reduction.', '2014-10-05 16:34:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269747, 1130917, 13077, '<td valign="top">The impression I get is that he''s posed against the brick wall, seemingly staring down the camera like it''s the pistol loaded with a bullet about to administer his sentence for some crime punishable by execution.<br/>It''s also a nice juxtaposition of a character straight from a farm onto a location that must have been new and shiny in the industrial age, but could now be in any weathered downtown area, around the corner from a bar serving PBR and Fireball and a sushi restaurant.<br/>If the intent was to leave the story up the viewer, you have succeeded greatly because I''ve been looking at this for a long time and it''s still fascinating.</td>', 'The impression I get is that he''s posed against the brick wall, seemingly staring down the camera like it''s the pistol loaded with a bullet about to administer his sentence for some crime punishable by execution.It''s also a nice juxtaposition of a character straight from a farm onto a location that must have been new and shiny in the industrial age, but could now be in any weathered downtown area, around the corner from a bar serving PBR and Fireball and a sushi restaurant.If the intent was to leave the story up the viewer, you have succeeded greatly because I''ve been looking at this for a long time and it''s still fascinating.', '2014-10-05 16:43:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269748, 1130374, 13077, '<td valign="top">At first I thought the rope could be a cobra, coiled and raising in triumph over its defeated adversary the venerable Woody.<br/>Now I see the glass cage and your title, and it takes on another meaning. Very intriguing.</td>', 'At first I thought the rope could be a cobra, coiled and raising in triumph over its defeated adversary the venerable Woody.Now I see the glass cage and your title, and it takes on another meaning. Very intriguing.', '2014-10-05 16:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269749, 1131082, 13077, '<td valign="top">Ouch.</td>', 'Ouch.', '2014-10-05 16:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7269750, 1131166, 13077, '<td valign="top">Excellent portrait. Simple but effective. Classic.<br/>And who couldn''t love those freckles?</td>', 'Excellent portrait. Simple but effective. Classic.And who couldn''t love those freckles?', '2014-10-05 16:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
