(7270171, 1130948, 138253, '<td valign="top">a 7 from me. the off-balance composition does not sit well in my mind for a musical score. A musical composition is precise and measured, and i feel the composition of the image should reflect that.<br/>The top-left (and a small bit in the bottom right of the score) is a bit blown-out, instead of two light sources, a diffused or bounced light to provide more even lighting would have prevented this.<br/> <br/>I would love to be able to give this a 9 or a 10, but the above mentioned bits are unable to be overlooked.</td>', 'a 7 from me. the off-balance composition does not sit well in my mind for a musical score. A musical composition is precise and measured, and i feel the composition of the image should reflect that.The top-left (and a small bit in the bottom right of the score) is a bit blown-out, instead of two light sources, a diffused or bounced light to provide more even lighting would have prevented this. I would love to be able to give this a 9 or a 10, but the above mentioned bits are unable to be overlooked.', '2014-10-06 10:33:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7270173, 1129796, 138253, '<td valign="top">while i''m not a fan of high key imagery, this is mostly well done.<br/>i find the noise overly applied on the skin - there''s nothing wrong with babies having creamy skin, to me the added noise just makes it look like she has a bit of dirt on her face.<br/>6</td>', 'while i''m not a fan of high key imagery, this is mostly well done.i find the noise overly applied on the skin - there''s nothing wrong with babies having creamy skin, to me the added noise just makes it look like she has a bit of dirt on her face.6', '2014-10-06 10:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
