(7270575, 1130993, 24073, '<td valign="top">a took a real double take at this shot.  Its is brilliantly composed ie. the balance is beautiful, the photo embraces curiosity, and allows the viewer to kind of fill in blanks, very thought provoking is what really got my attention, for that I scored very high 9, I hope you do well.</td>', 'a took a real double take at this shot.  Its is brilliantly composed ie. the balance is beautiful, the photo embraces curiosity, and allows the viewer to kind of fill in blanks, very thought provoking is what really got my attention, for that I scored very high 9, I hope you do well.', '2014-10-07 08:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7270577, 1129221, 24073, '<td valign="top">very dreamy, elegant, balanced, and overall healthy colors.  If there was one thing to critique, it would only be lacking interesting subject matter.  And that is mild, because it has grace to fill in the vacancy.  I just wonder if like a swing in the tree, or maybe a child in the bottom left blowing bubbles or jumping rope wouldn''t give it a bigger story.  I scored high, I enjoy it very much.</td>', 'very dreamy, elegant, balanced, and overall healthy colors.  If there was one thing to critique, it would only be lacking interesting subject matter.  And that is mild, because it has grace to fill in the vacancy.  I just wonder if like a swing in the tree, or maybe a child in the bottom left blowing bubbles or jumping rope wouldn''t give it a bigger story.  I scored high, I enjoy it very much.', '2014-10-07 09:02:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7270578, 1131149, 24073, '<td valign="top">A gorgeous shot overall, I love it.  When I went to do my second look through I couldn''t help but to wonder about the colored version.  I''ll bet you were torn between the two, maybe not.  I couldn''t say the other would of been better, not having seen the other, and because I like this one so much.  Great job.</td>', 'A gorgeous shot overall, I love it.  When I went to do my second look through I couldn''t help but to wonder about the colored version.  I''ll bet you were torn between the two, maybe not.  I couldn''t say the other would of been better, not having seen the other, and because I like this one so much.  Great job.', '2014-10-07 09:05:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7270579, 1131074, 24073, '<td valign="top">Even though the rule of thirds is well practiced here, I almost missed the lighthouse.  I did miss it actually, until i read the title.  I loved it after seeing it up there, with its beautiful amber light, I just wish it was more prolific in the capture.  It doesn''t take away a huge part, because the rest of the photo has been done so well. great job.</td>', 'Even though the rule of thirds is well practiced here, I almost missed the lighthouse.  I did miss it actually, until i read the title.  I loved it after seeing it up there, with its beautiful amber light, I just wish it was more prolific in the capture.  It doesn''t take away a huge part, because the rest of the photo has been done so well. great job.', '2014-10-07 09:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7270583, 1130853, 114225, '<td valign="top">I find this oddly inviting.</td>', 'I find this oddly inviting.', '2014-10-07 10:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7270592, 1130212, 138253, '<td valign="top">Looks like a scene from a fantasy world. beautiful, serene, magical with a hint of danger in the woods around.<br/>10 and a favorite</td>', 'Looks like a scene from a fantasy world. beautiful, serene, magical with a hint of danger in the woods around.10 and a favorite', '2014-10-07 11:16:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7270593, 1130110, 138253, '<td valign="top">the composition of this image is it''s biggest setback in my opinion.<br/>it looks like you had a beautiful day (the touch of blue at the bottom, reflected in the lake), and if you opened this frame up to have some sky, with the lake low in the frame, and bring some more of the hills into view i feel it would have much more impact, where this sadly feels flat.<br/>5</td>', 'the composition of this image is it''s biggest setback in my opinion.it looks like you had a beautiful day (the touch of blue at the bottom, reflected in the lake), and if you opened this frame up to have some sky, with the lake low in the frame, and bring some more of the hills into view i feel it would have much more impact, where this sadly feels flat.5', '2014-10-07 11:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7270595, 1131054, 138253, '<td valign="top">in the beginning, everything was a blurry handscape. And the lord spoke and said "let there be light" and there was light, and it was good. ;)<br/>7</td>', 'in the beginning, everything was a blurry handscape. And the lord spoke and said "let there be light" and there was light, and it was good. ;)7', '2014-10-07 11:22:39.000000', NULL, 1),
