(7270614, 1130949, 150277, '<td valign="top">I find myself a bit unsure about this image.  On one hand it came across as a wonderful family moment, but I found the rails in the back of the image (behind the woman''s head) a bit distracting.  I wonder if less zoomed in, to present a bit more of the track, might have given me more of a wow feeling.  Or perhaps had images been taken a few seconds later when the shot could have been cropped closer to the subjects to show only that fun curve in the track.</td>', 'I find myself a bit unsure about this image.  On one hand it came across as a wonderful family moment, but I found the rails in the back of the image (behind the woman''s head) a bit distracting.  I wonder if less zoomed in, to present a bit more of the track, might have given me more of a wow feeling.  Or perhaps had images been taken a few seconds later when the shot could have been cropped closer to the subjects to show only that fun curve in the track.', '2014-10-07 12:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
