(7271180, 1130543, 32641, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by MadMan2k:</b></div><hr/><i> Looks like a landscape from another world. I like the layered mountains and the desolate foreground. Is it the aftermath of a forest fire? </i></td></tr></table> <br/>This is a lava field near Volcano Hekla.</td>', 'Originally posted by MadMan2k: Looks like a landscape from another world. I like the layered mountains and the desolate foreground. Is it the aftermath of a forest fire?  This is a lava field near Volcano Hekla.', '2014-10-08 07:16:40.000000', NULL, 0),
