(7271237, 1130755, 102278, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by bvy:</b></div><hr/><i> She''s growing fast! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Ah, this young lady isn''t mine Brian. This photograph was actually from a wedding i shot. All the guests were camping by the lake at the venue in the National Park where i live. A very relaxed chilled wedding. I''ve shot a couple of weddings there now - great spot.<br/> <br/>This also means i have no idea who Mrs Durphin is either, or why her name is written on the chalk board.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2014-10-08 08:21:11.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by bvy: She''s growing fast!   Ah, this young lady isn''t mine Brian. This photograph was actually from a wedding i shot. All the guests were camping by the lake at the venue in the National Park where i live. A very relaxed chilled wedding. I''ve shot a couple of weddings there now - great spot. This also means i have no idea who Mrs Durphin is either, or why her name is written on the chalk board.', '2014-10-08 09:19:17.000000', '2014-10-08 09:21:11.000000', 0),
