(7271597, 1130385, 140537, '<td valign="top">Great portrait!<br/>I am curious how you made the decision on which portrait to choose.<br/>I am flipping between the two. Jinjoo''s ears and the angle of his body in your alternate picture are quite interesting. Those ears! I often find myself flipping between two highly similar photos, struggling to select the right one. <br/> <br/>Also, flip back and forth very quickly and these would make a great animated GIF.<br/> <br/>One more also... You must be quite the extrovert. I cannot imagine meeting someone at a car wash with the end result being this photo.<br/>Or any photo, really... <br/>Kudos</td>', 'Great portrait!I am curious how you made the decision on which portrait to choose.I am flipping between the two. Jinjoo''s ears and the angle of his body in your alternate picture are quite interesting. Those ears! I often find myself flipping between two highly similar photos, struggling to select the right one.  Also, flip back and forth very quickly and these would make a great animated GIF. One more also... You must be quite the extrovert. I cannot imagine meeting someone at a car wash with the end result being this photo.Or any photo, really... Kudos', '2014-10-09 08:24:05.000000', NULL, 0),
