(7271806, 1130548, 14476, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club<br/> <br/>Well, <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=156466" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">backdoorhippie</a>, "back at ya." <br/> <br/>Now it''s my turn to critique one of yours!<br/> <br/>Going strictly on what you show in the image and your title, whoa: "way too busy" "what''s the subject?"<br/>Those are the first questions that come to mind.  Then, hey, what a strange mask; a dog''s face would fit<br/>in one of those.  If I was voting I''d just go with the first 2 observations and keep going.<br/> <br/>But looking at it in a critiquing mode - especially with your explanation, I''d just say that you had a great <br/>story to tell, but the story needed to be distilled down to its essentials.  There is so much information <br/>in there, the super story was lost.  (IMO of course)<br/> <br/>Thank you for this image.  I did wonder, upon occasion, how the dogs were protected, or even if they were<br/>protected.</td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club Well,  backdoorhippie, "back at ya."  Now it''s my turn to critique one of yours! Going strictly on what you show in the image and your title, whoa: "way too busy" "what''s the subject?"Those are the first questions that come to mind.  Then, hey, what a strange mask; a dog''s face would fitin one of those.  If I was voting I''d just go with the first 2 observations and keep going. But looking at it in a critiquing mode - especially with your explanation, I''d just say that you had a great story to tell, but the story needed to be distilled down to its essentials.  There is so much information in there, the super story was lost.  (IMO of course) Thank you for this image.  I did wonder, upon occasion, how the dogs were protected, or even if they wereprotected.', '2014-10-09 21:51:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(7271808, 1130944, 14476, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club:<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=120432" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Juliannj</a> - gee whiz, lady, you sure do know how to take a sky photograph!<br/> <br/>This image is splendid and your excellent score in a Free Study lets you know that your fellow voters agree. <br/> <br/>Your handling of lights, darks and colors work well in this sky study.  <br/> <br/>About all I can say, is "keep up the good work!"<br/> <br/>Alice</td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club:  Juliannj - gee whiz, lady, you sure do know how to take a sky photograph! This image is splendid and your excellent score in a Free Study lets you know that your fellow voters agree.  Your handling of lights, darks and colors work well in this sky study.   About all I can say, is "keep up the good work!" Alice', '2014-10-09 22:01:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(7271814, 1130944, 14476, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club:<br/> <br/>21_F.gif Juliannj - gee whiz, lady, you sure do know how to take a sky photograph!<br/> <br/>This image is splendid and your excellent score in a Free Study lets you know that your fellow voters agree.<br/> <br/>Your handling of lights, darks and colors work well in this sky study.<br/> <br/>About all I can say, is "keep up the good work!"<br/> <br/>Alice<br/> <br/>PS - and if you get this twice, well, I still mean it!</td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club: 21_F.gif Juliannj - gee whiz, lady, you sure do know how to take a sky photograph! This image is splendid and your excellent score in a Free Study lets you know that your fellow voters agree. Your handling of lights, darks and colors work well in this sky study. About all I can say, is "keep up the good work!" Alice PS - and if you get this twice, well, I still mean it!', '2014-10-09 22:52:54.000000', NULL, 0),
