(7274876, 1130891, 38162, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by mariuca:</b></div><hr/><i> So you made it on the roof and got a more optimistic view than mine<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1120463" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1936/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1120463.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1936/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1120463.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1936/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1120463.jpg"/></a> <br/>I like the autumnal undertones </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>indeed, and yours is far superior.  great fun up there as always.  never did get a "big bamboo" one that I really liked.</td>', 'Originally posted by mariuca: So you made it on the roof and got a more optimistic view than mine I like the autumnal undertones   indeed, and yours is far superior.  great fun up there as always.  never did get a "big bamboo" one that I really liked.', '2014-10-18 00:54:42.000000', NULL, 0),
